8-dev-workflow.md", "rationale": ".xcodeproj is hard to edit without Xcode and often conflicts in git."}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0028_dev_workflow_d28", "label": "D-28 Dev workflow: cloud + Mac, iOS build in CI", "file_type": "document", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "source_file": "docs/decisions/0028-dev-workflow.md", "rationale": "Cloud sessions lack Xcode, so CI on macOS verifies iOS code on every push."}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0028_dev_workflow_mixed_cloud_mac_mode", "label": "\u0421\u043c\u0435\u0448\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0440\u0435\u0436\u0438\u043c: \u043e\u0431\u043b\u0430\u0447\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0441\u0435\u0441\u0441\u0438\u0438 (Linux, \u0431\u0435\u0437 Xcode) + Mac \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0441\u0431\u043e\u0440\u043a\u0438 \u0438 iPad", "file_type": "concept", "source_location": "L13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "source_file": "docs/decisions/0028-dev-workflow.md"}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0028_dev_workflow_github_actions_ios_ci", "label": "GitHub Actions \u0441\u043e\u0431\u0438\u0440\u0430\u0435\u0442 iOS \u043d\u0430 macOS-\u0440\u0430\u043d\u043d\u0435\u0440\u0435 \u043d\u0430 \u043a\u0430\u0436\u0434\u044b\u0439 push", "file_type": "concept", "source_location": "L14", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "source_file": "docs/decisions/0028-dev-workflow.md", "rationale": "iOS-\u043a\u043e\u0434, \u043d\u0430\u043f\u0438\u0441\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0432 \u043e\u0431\u043b\u0430\u043a\u0435 \u0431\u0435\u0437 Xcode, \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u044f\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0443"}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_decisions_0028_dev_workflow", "target": "docs_decisions_0028_dev_workflow_d_28_\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0446\u0435\u0441\u0441_\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0440\u0430\u0431